 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure shown. Draw a graph that fits the given description.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/cae67cd553206cc0.png\" alt=\"Four graphs. Each graph has four vertices: a, b, c, and d. The first graph shows the following edges: a c, c d, and c b. The second graph shows the following edges: a b, b d, and d c. The third graph shows the following edges: b a, a c, and cd. The fourth graph shows the following edges: a d, b d, and c d.\">\n",
